{"id":"torrey:feast-of-pentecost-the","source":"torrey","name":"Feast Of Pentecost, The","slug":"feast-of-pentecost-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Held fiftieth day after offering first sheaf of barley harvest — Le 23:15,16; De 16:9.","refs":[["Lev",23,15,23,15],["Lev",23,16,23,16],["Deut",16,9,16,9]]},{"text":"Feast of harvest. — Ex 23:16.","refs":[["Exod",23,16,23,16]]},{"text":"Feast of weeks. — Ex 34:22; De 16:10.","refs":[["Exod",34,22,34,22],["Deut",16,10,16,10]]},{"text":"Day of the first fruits. — Nu 28:26.","refs":[["Num",28,26,28,26]]},{"text":"Day of Pentecost. — Ac 2:1.","refs":[["Acts",2,1,2,1]]},{"text":"To be perpetually observed — Le 23:21.","refs":[["Lev",23,21,23,21]]},{"text":"All males to attend — Ex 23:16,17; De 16:16.","refs":[["Exod",23,16,23,16],["Exod",23,17,23,17],["Deut",16,16,16,16]]},{"text":"A holy convocation — Le 23:21; Nu 28:26.","refs":[["Lev",23,21,23,21],["Num",28,26,28,26]]},{"text":"A time of holy rejoicing — De 16:11,12.","refs":[["Deut",16,11,16,11],["Deut",16,12,16,12]]},{"text":"The first fruits of bread presented at — Le 23:17; De 16:10.","refs":[["Lev",23,17,23,17],["Deut",16,10,16,10]]},{"text":"Sacrifices at — Le 23:18,19; Nu 28:27-31.","refs":[["Lev",23,18,23,18],["Lev",23,19,23,19],["Num",28,27,28,31]]},{"text":"The law given from Mount Sinai upon — Ex 12:6,12; 19:1,11.","refs":[["Exod",12,6,12,6],["Exod",12,12,12,12],["Exod",19,1,19,1],["Exod",19,11,19,11]]},{"text":"The Holy Spirit given to apostles at — Ac 2:1-3.","refs":[["Acts",2,1,2,3]]},{"text":"Observed by the church — Ac 20:16; 1Co 16:8.","refs":[["Acts",20,16,20,16],["1Cor",16,8,16,8]]}],"refCount":28}
